+// Keeps open menus and other popups in front. Qt for Android stacks its
+// windows as views in the activity, and moving from one open menu to the next
+// (hovering along the menu bar) hands focus back to the main window, which Qt
+// then raises over the menu that just opened. Raises the open popups again,
+// in the order they opened.
